OL,3,GNEWSADate set for aunt and niece fire
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man charged with murdering a woman
OL,7,Fand her seven-year-old niece in a house
OL,8,Ffire will go on trial next year.
OL,10,FNatalie McDonald, 34, and Valentina
OL,11,FFoster died in the blaze in Grangetown,
OL,12,Fnear Middlesbrough, in the early hours
OL,13,Fof 26 August.
OL,15,FJaden Wright, 23, appeared via video
OL,16,Flink at Teesside Crown Court charged
OL,17,Fwith two counts of murder as well as
OL,18,Ffour other charges linked to the fire.
OL,19,FA judge set a date of 14 April 2027 for
OL,20,Fany trial to begin.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
